Notes:\par
\par
1)\tab Implementation of this patch depends on the prior implementation \tab of the 05-Aug-2015 LE\{ft\} command message change as described \tab above.\par
\par
2)\tab As of this writing, this patch has not received rigorous testing.  \tab The only P?S/8 Version 8Z configuration presently released is for \tab TC01/TC08/TU55/TU56; as such, the release file pqs8_tc08.tu56 \tab [image file for use with the SIMH PDP-8 simulator] will also be \tab available without this patch; the unpatched file will be known as \tab pqs_tc08_05-Aug-2015.tu56 consistent with the previous patch \tab level.\par
